<title>UK: SQUASH-WORLD TEAM CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-WORLD TEAM CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the women's world team</p>
<p>squash championships on Monday:</p>
<p>Pool A:</p>
<p>Australia beat Germany 3-0</p>
<p>Michelle Martin beat Sabine Schone 9-4 9-1 9-1</p>
<p>Liz Irving beat Sabine Baum 9-2 4-9 10-8 9-5</p>
<p>Carol Owens beat Karin Beriere 9-0 9-0 9-3</p>
<p>South Africa beat United States 3-0</p>
<p>Claire Nitch beat Demer Holleran 9-0 9-1 9-4</p>
<p>Carla Venter beat Ellie Pierce 10-9 9-1 9-1</p>
<p>Chantal Clifton-Parks beat Alicia McConnell 9-5 9-3 9-2</p>
<p>Pool B:</p>
<p>England beat Egypt 3-0</p>
<p>Suzanne Horner beat Salma Shabana 9-4 9-0 9-0</p>
<p>Linda Charman beat Maha Zein 9-1 9-5 7-9 9-0</p>
<p>Fiona Geaves beat Heb Abu Ouf 9-4 9-0 9-0</p>
<p>New Zealand beat Netherlands 3-0</p>
<p>Philippa Beams beat Vanessa Atkinson 9-4 9-1 9-0</p>
<p>Leitani Marsh beat Nicole Beumer 4-9 9-3 9-2 5-9 9-3</p>
<p>Sarah Cook beat Denise Sommers 9-7 9-5 9-0</p>
<p>Pool C:</p>
<p>Finland beat Ireland 3-0</p>
<p>Tuula Mylyniemi beat Aisling McArdle 9-1 9-2 9-1</p>
<p>Nina Taimiaho beat Louise Finnegan 9-7 10-9 9-4</p>
<p>Kia Paasivirta beat Olivia French 10-8 9-1 9-3</p>
<p>Pool D:</p>
<p>France beat Japan 3-0</p>
<p>Corinne Castets beat Yuka Kimura 9-1 9-2 9-5</p>
<p>Isabelle Stoerh beat Miyuki Adachi 9-1 9-2 9-4</p>
<p>Corinne Vezin beat Misako Sugo 9-1 9-5 9-3</p>
<p>Scotland beat Hong Kong 3-0</p>
<p>Senga Macfie beat Dawn Olsen 9-6 9-1 9-0</p>
<p>Wendy Maitland beat Rebecca Chiu 9-2 9-0 9-3</p>
<p>Pamela Nimmo beat Chrisina Mark 9-2 9-7 9-2</p>
<p>Pool E:</p>
<p>Spain beat Brazil 2-1 (Spanish names first)</p>
<p>Natalie Menen beat Flavia Roberts 9-7 9-0 9-3</p>
<p>Elizabet Sado lost to Adrianna Moura 6-9 7-9 6-9</p>
<p>Maria Salvia beat Aline Laginestra 9-3 6-9 9-3 9-2</p>
<p>Denmark beat Italy 2-1 (Danish names first)</p>
<p>Ellen Hamborg-Peterson lost to Teresa Beresford 2-9 2-9 0-9</p>
<p>Julie Dorn-Jensen beat Sonia Pasteris 9-0 9-5 9-1</p>
<p>Elsebeth Jensen beat Elena Cambi 9-7 2-9 9-7 9-6</p>
</text>
